    "retrieved": "2026-09-24",
    "transformation": "Subset only. Every hex value is byte-copied (lower-cased). ACVP otherInput entries become ordered steps: intendedUse reSeed -> {op: reseed}; generate -> {op: generate}, carrying entropyInput only when predResistance is true. CAVP EntropyInputReseed/AdditionalInputReseed -> a leading reseed step; each AdditionalInput (and EntropyInputPR when PredictionResistance = True) -> a generate step. returnedBits is the output of the LAST generate step, as in both upstream formats.",
    "semantics": "Instantiate(entropyInput, nonce, personalizationString); then run steps in order. A generate step with entropyInput (prediction resistance) is Reseed(entropyInput, additionalInput) followed by Generate with no additional input (SP 800-90A Rev. 1 \u00a79.3.1 step 7). Each generate returns returnedBitsLen bits.",
